        {
          "topic": "Agriculture",
          "value": "Ensure California remains an agricultural leader that provides good careers for the Central Valley and food for the world",
          "snippet": "It is critical to ensure California remains an agricultural leader that provides good careers for the Central Valley and food for the world."
